B.V8=new A.e9("Cavite City, one of the oldest cities in the Philippines, served as a major Spanish naval port and the site of defining historical events including the Cavite Mutiny of 1872, the execution of the Gomburza priests, and the Declaration of Philippine Independence in 1898. The game preserves this rich heritage through six scripted narrative acts, each set in a distinct historical period.",null,B.iA,null,null,null,null,null,null)
